! --- SCAT ---
PRINT("Testing SCAT...")
TNS: dst_scat = [[0d0,0d0,0d0],[0d0,0d0,0d0]]
TNS: src_scat = [[0d1, 0d2],[0d3, 0d4]]
TNS: ind_scat = [[0d1, 0d2],[0d1, 0d2]]
